{"3683160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mad Experiments: Escape Room - Sanctuary", "steam_appid": 3683160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the award-winning creator of Mad Experiments: Escape Room 1 &amp; 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a brand-new first-person escape-room adventure for 1–4 players (60–90 min). A forsaken convent hides the Horn of the Fallen One, Scepter of Radiance, and Abbot’s Ring behind a web of ritual, light, and music trials—will you reclaim them all before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless cross-platform co-op</strong> – PC, Mac, and Linux players team up instantly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-relic quest</strong> – unite Horn, Scepter, and Ring on the altar to open the final door. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature set-piece puzzles</strong> – bend a mirror-guided light beam, ring a bell melody, and piece together the abbots’ chronology. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden-prison finale</strong> – uncover a sealed passage beneath the cloisters for one last, pulse-pounding challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced narrative</strong> – every clue and revelation delivered by professional performers. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the award-winning creator of Mad Experiments: Escape Room 1 &amp; 2</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a brand-new first-person escape-room adventure for 1–4 players (60–90 min). A forsaken convent hides the Horn of the Fallen One, Scepter of Radiance, and Abbot’s Ring behind a web of ritual, light, and music trials—will you reclaim them all before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_pa